        <div class="ed-byline-text">
          By <a href="/editorial-standards/#who" rel="author">Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD</a><br />
          Updated November 5, 2026 · Exercise Physiology & Biomechanics Specialist · ACSM-EP, CSCS
        </div>
        <a href="#top-picks" class="btn-ghost">View products</a>
      </div>
      <p class="ed-disclosure">
        We research every product on this page independently. If you buy through our links, we may earn a
        commission at no cost to you. <a href="/editorial-standards/">Learn more about how we review.</a>
      </p>

      <figure class="ed-hero">
        <div class="ed-hero-collage">
          <a href="#horizon-7-0-at"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/314wh+sUlyL._SL500_.jpg" alt="Horizon 7.0 AT" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
          <a href="#horizon-fitness-7-4-at"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41wMaZFsNwL._SL500_.jpg" alt="Horizon Fitness 7.4 AT" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
          <a href="#bowflex-t16"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31I8-29nvEL._SL500_.jpg" alt="Bowflex T16" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
        </div>
        <figcaption>Horizon 7.0 AT · Horizon Fitness 7.4 AT · Bowflex T16</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="ed-body prose prose-lg">
        <p class="ed-lead">
          Searches for "Nautilus treadmill" are still common, and so are the machines: plenty of T614s, T616s
          and T618s were sold through Best Buy, Walmart, Amazon and nautilus.com in the late 2010s and early
          2020s, and they now fill local marketplace listings. What has gone is everything behind them. Nautilus
          Inc. stopped selling treadmills under its own name, sold the Nautilus brand in 2023, renamed itself
          BowFlex Inc., went through Chapter 11 in 2024 and was bought by Johnson Health Tech, the Taiwanese
          group behind Horizon, Matrix and Vision. The T616 and T618 also carry a recall whose remedy no longer
          exists. This guide sets out what each Nautilus model was, the figures we could confirm, how to tell a
          recalled unit apart, and which current Bowflex and Schwinn treadmills are the closest replacements.
        </p>

