              <a href={PRODUCTS[3].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="tp-label"><span class="tp-award">Closest to the T614:</span> <a href="#schwinn-810">Schwinn 810</a></span>
              <a href={PRODUCTS[4].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <aside class="ed-note not-prose">
          <span class="ed-note-k">What we checked</span>
          <strong class="text-gray-900">What we checked, and what we have not done.</strong> On
          5 November 2026 we checked nautilus.com (which now sells a vibration plate, supplements and
          apparel, and no treadmills), Bowflex's US treadmill page and prices, Schwinn Fitness's US store and
          product specification pages, the US Consumer Product Safety Commission's recall notice 22-153 and its
          recall database for Nautilus, Bowflex and Johnson Health Tech, local and trade press on the 2023 sale
